avs have better chances of pulling through. Donovan Mitchell needs to be better as well in helping this team win, 10 points on 10 shots is not the move.All NBA Odds on FanDuelGame odds refresh periodically and are subject to change. If you or someone you know has a gambling problem and wants help, call 1-800-GAMBLER.Cavaliers 2025-2026 ScheduleSunday, Apr 5 vs. IndianaMonday, Apr. 6 @ MemphisWednesday, Apr. 8 vs. AtlantaAdd us as a preferred source on GoogleFollow",
